 "_design_r1": "Overlord dropkick loop (active, held while falling): the startup's extended pose as a moving hold, period 12 (f11 -> f0 is an ordinary step): legs recoil 3% right after the thrust (f0-f3) and re-extend slowly (f3-f11), pelvis breathes +-1.5 cm, trunk, head and arms trail the legs by 1-2 frames. Never frozen.",
 "_changes": "k6 (2026-11-21, owner on the K5 r3 videos): NEW strike settle: body overshoot f2, head overshoot f4, arms loosen f4-f7, rebound f7, = loop f11 at f11. Previous: k5 (2026-11-21, owner on the r4 videos): smug fall: strike pose held, chest out, chin up, slow pleased head tilt, arms crossed. Previous: r2 (2026-11-15, owner decision 1A): Antigravity r0 poses resto"
}